{"path":"utility/functional/function/swap","title":"std::function<R(Args...)>::swap","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::function&lt;R(Args...)&gt;::</span>swap","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/functional/function/swap","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Exchanges the stored callable objects of *this and other.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> swap<span class=\"br0\">(</span> function<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Exchanges the stored callable objects of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code>other</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  function wrapper to exchange the stored callable object with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;functional&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> foo<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> str, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> x<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"foo(<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> str <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>, \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> x <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\")<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> bar<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> str, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> x<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"bar(<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> str <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>, \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> x <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\")<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/function\"><span class=\"kw1066\">std::<span class=\"me2\">function</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> f1<span class=\"br0\">{</span>foo<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/function\"><span class=\"kw1066\">std::<span class=\"me2\">function</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">